+# Audit 0.14.0: little celebrations
+
+Method: design review only (detector not applicable, native platform): impeccable critique
+(emotional journey, craft floor "one authored moment") and graphic-design-fundamentals §13, on
+`celebration_full_nap_light`, `celebration_quiet_ptBR_dark`, and the rules in `CelebrationsTest`.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals §13
+
+| # | Check | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | A congratulations moment with positive words and the animated baby, when an intent is met. ✅ |
+| 2 | Concept | The baby lifts its arms: one gesture, the peak of the end of a good nap. ✅ |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | One line, the avatar beside it; nothing else on the card. ✅ |
+| 4 | Contrast | The first card (surface over surface) had no edge over the screen; now a blush (`selected`) with a hairline; `on-selected` 12:1. ✅ after fix |
+| 5 | Alignment | Under the header, full width within the gutter, away from the thumb and the Log button. ✅ |
+| 6 | Spacing | Tokens only. ✅ |
+| 7 | Typography | Label role by day; body-small, muted, at night. ✅ |
+| 8 | Colour | Blush, never teal (teal is the action). ✅ |
+| 9 | Consistency | Motion from `Motion.kt`: rise in, sink out, emphasised lift. ✅ |
+| 10 | Simplicity | One moment, one line, gone by itself. ✅ |
+| 11 | Real size | Checked at phone size, light and dark, EN and PT. ✅ |
+| 12 | Accessibility | Polite live region; Remove animations honoured; at night no motion and no bright card. ✅ |
+| 13 | Production | No assets; one Canvas drawing. ✅ |
+
+## impeccable critique
+
+Emotional journey: the end of a good nap becomes a peak (peak-end); nothing creates a valley
+(no scolding, no broken streaks). Persona check, 3 a.m.: the quiet mode shows words only, dim.
+
+| # | Heuristic | Score | Note |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | System status | 4 | Confirms the moment the parent cares about. |
+| 2 | Real world | 4 | Her words, the baby's name. |
+| 3 | Control | 4 | Tap to dismiss; a switch to turn it off. |
+| 4 | Consistency | 4 | Same motion vocabulary as the rest. |
+| 5 | Error prevention | n/a | Nothing to get wrong. |
+| 6 | Recognition | 4 | The baby she chose. |
+| 7 | Efficiency | 4 | Never blocks or waits. |
+| 8 | Aesthetic | 4 | One authored moment. |
+| 9 | Error recovery | n/a | — |
+| 10 | Help | 3 | The Settings line says what it is. |
+| | **Total** | **31/32** | |
